WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.125
-Guess! I'm gonna be in the newspaper!
-That lady wants to interview us on TV!

00:00:04.166 --> 00:00:06.041
-Most "likes" ever.
-Me too.

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:08.500
-How cool is that?
-Yeah!

00:00:09.125 --> 00:00:11.666
Let's go home
and put these trophies on display!

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:15.041
I wish everyone thought
I was special.

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:18.000
♪ They say it doesn't matter ♪

00:00:18.125 --> 00:00:20.625
♪ How you look or where you've been&nbsp;♪

00:00:20.666 --> 00:00:22.875
♪ So why do&nbsp;I need a thousand likes&nbsp;♪

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.125
♪ To feel like I&nbsp;fit in?&nbsp;♪

00:00:25.791 --> 00:00:28.666
♪ I'd probably have it easy&nbsp;♪

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.750
♪ If I&nbsp;were the only kid&nbsp;♪

00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:33.416
♪ But when you live with&nbsp;ten superstars&nbsp;♪

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.375
♪ It's hard for you to&nbsp;win&nbsp;♪

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.791
♪ I wish I could be&nbsp;♪

00:00:38.875 --> 00:00:41.125
♪ Someone extraordinary&nbsp;♪

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:43.625
♪ But I'm just me&nbsp;♪

00:00:43.666 --> 00:00:46.250
♪ And that's too&nbsp;ordinary&nbsp;♪

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:51.875
♪ Is there ever&nbsp;gonna be
A place in the spotlight just for me?&nbsp;♪

00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:57.375
♪ When the world can finally&nbsp;see
I'm special like my family&nbsp;♪

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.291
♪ Will there be a time&nbsp;♪

00:00:59.875 --> 00:01:01.625
♪ When I really shine?&nbsp;♪

00:01:02.416 --> 00:01:04.416
♪ Am I always gonna be&nbsp;♪

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:07.500
♪Plain old ordinary&nbsp;me?&nbsp;♪

00:01:07.541 --> 00:01:09.875
♪ Ah-ah-ah&nbsp;♪

00:01:09.916 --> 00:01:12.541
♪ Plain old ordinary me?&nbsp;♪

00:01:12.625 --> 00:01:15.000
♪ Am I always&nbsp;gonna be&nbsp;♪

00:01:15.041 --> 00:01:18.666
♪ Plain old, regular,&nbsp;boring&nbsp;♪

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:23.375
♪ Unremarkable, ordinary me?&nbsp;♪

